# Ergo's real exchange: two nicks taken, the second padded form is free.
= nick taken
= caps multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK taken
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :ergo.test CAP * LS :multi-prefix
> CAP REQ multi-prefix
< :ergo.test CAP * ACK multi-prefix
> CAP END
< :ergo.test 433 * taken :Nickname is already in use
> NICK taken_
? notice The nick taken is already in use; trying taken_
< :ergo.test 433 * taken_ :Nickname is already in use
> NICK taken__
